Remove the Windows user name and the Unix home name (Z:/home/<name> under Proton) from the game's own log (log file, stdout echo, ring, crash report).
Apply from the repo root: git apply tools/release/kz3-log-redact.patch (tools/release/test_game_log_redact.py checks it).

